Cell["\<\
By default an event depends on an earlier one when they share anything at \
all. Counting only whole shared edges relates fewer of them:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"fbb13d65-0f34-aa47-8462-5ff59f7e1a7e"],

