Cell["\<\
The pairs that drop out are the ones whose matches meet only at a vertex:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"06653990-7dd7-824f-9a86-f58f3f9d2b7f"],

Cell["\<\
pairsOf[l_] := {#[\"From\"], #[\"To\"]} & /@ l;
Complement[pairsOf @ twoEdges[\"CausalEdges\", 2],
           pairsOf @ twoEdges[\"CausalEdges\", 2, \"CausalDependence\" -> \
\"Edges\"]]\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"aff3c185-5aa1-7447-af95-9ce084f3e6e1"],

